rovided in the zip folder with the code and then it is compared with Kaggle results so the accuracy what we get over here might slightly vary from the accuracy we achieve in Kaggle submission. Totally 3 diverse types of neural network operations are tried on this dataset i.e. 1) Single Hidden MLP 2) RNN 3) DNN each Neural Net is processed in different ipynb files before combining it. DNN is my baseline model because I achieved my maximum accuracy of 88.53% while processing data with it and rank achieved in it is 1335 out of 9,803.","topics":[],"score":236386,"global_rank":89533},{"name":"shik3519/deep-learning","owner":"shik3519","html_url":"https://github.com/shik3519/deep-learning","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":["cnn-model","dataloader","pytorch"],"score":236382,"global_rank":89537},{"name":"xinyi329/AgriculTrends","owner":"xinyi329","html_url":"https://github.com/xinyi329/AgriculTrends","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Project of Big Data Application Development @ NYU","topics":[],"score":236379,"global_rank":89543},{"name":"haynaou/DS-Certificate-UW","owner":"haynaou","html_url":"https://github.com/haynaou/DS-Certificate-UW","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Courses taken during the Certificate in Data Science Program at the University of Washington https://www.pce.uw.edu/certificates/data-science","topics":[],"score":236379,"global_rank":89547},{"name":"kmesiab/concept-model-experiment-protein-folding","owner":"kmesiab","html_url":"https://github.com/kmesiab/concept-model-experiment-protein-folding","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Jupyter notebook experiment identify the constraints of and test the prediction capability of amino acids in the Concept Model 4 Layer Matrix ","topics":[],"score":236369,"global_rank":89555},{"name